/*
This is a placeholder for the YOLOv5n watermark detection model.

The actual model file is too large to include here (approximately 2.7MB).

To use this feature:
1. Download the YOLOv5n watermark detection model from:
   https://github.com/CS-Presence/quantized-models/releases

2. Place the file 'yolov5n_watermark.onnx' in the app/src/main/assets/ directory

3. The model is trained to detect:
   - Watermark (class 0)
   - Subtitle (class 1)
   - Logo (class 2)

4. The model expects 320x320 RGB input with normalized values [0,1]

5. Output format: [batch_size, num_boxes, 85] where:
   - x, y, width, height: normalized coordinates (0-1)
   - confidence: objectness score
   - class_probabilities: 3-class probabilities

6. The model has been quantized for mobile deployment and runs efficiently on Android.
*/